{title: Ishq Nahi Karte}
{artist: B Praak Jaani}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm] Kaali Kaali Kaali,        Kaali [Cm] Raatein Karte [F] Ho
[Gm] Kaali Kaali Kaali,        Kaali [Cm] Raatein Karte [F] Ho
Tum [D#] Ishq Nahi Karte,        Bas [Gm] Baatein Karte Ho
Tum [D#] Ishq Nahin Karte,        Bas [Gm] Baatein Karte Ho
[Gm] Hum Milne Ko Kahe Toh,        Haan [Cm] Milte Bhi [F] Nahi
Arey [D#] Murde Ho Kya Tum,        Jo [Gm] Itna Akadte Ho
Tum [D#] Ishq Nahi Karte,        Bas [Gm] Baatein Karte Ho
Tum [D#] Ishq Nahin Karte,        Bas [Gm] Baatein Karte Ho
Ho [Gm] Badi Koshish Ki [Cm] Humne,        [F] Sudhara Na [Cm] Gaya
[Gm] Humse Tera [Cm] Kaafir,        [Gm] Maara Na [Cm] Gaya
[Gm] Mujhe Lagta Tha,        Jao [Cm] ge Sudhar [F] Jaani
[D#] Jismon Ke Bhookhe The,        [Gm] Jismon Pe Marte Ho
Tum [D#] Ishq Nahi Karte,        Bas [Gm] Baatein Karte Ho
Tum [D#] Ishq Nahin Karte,        Bas [Gm] Baatein Karte Ho
[Gm] Ab Humse Zyada [Cm] Jinki,        [Gm] Tumhein Zaroorat [Cm] Hai
[Gm] Woh Acha Nahi [Cm] Humse,        Bas [Gm] Khoobsurat [Cm] Hai
[Gm] Hum Kehte Hi Nahi Bas,        Hume [Cm] Sab Pata Hai [F] Par
Tum [D#] Kisse Chhup Chhup Kar,        Mula [Gm] kaatein Karte Ho
Tum [D#] Ishq Nahi Karte,        Bas [Gm] Baatein Karte Ho
Tum [D#] Ishq Nahin Karte,        Bas [Gm] Baatein Karte Ho
